":"juXS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e642f60-4787-4dc6-a150-cba3a120b7ab","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"48858","ts":"1633662786.251100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"svME"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fb0cb79-54b9-43e1-be83-bbe8a74acac4","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"その割には番号に必然性がないですね…","ts":"1633662761.250900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fyhs1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9009469d-e736-44b7-9d19-b6cfc4817915","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"reserve、issue番号を固定したいとかなんかな。 (issue-12345 みたいな repo 作りたい的な)","ts":"1633662400.250600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jdol"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a617a48f-76ce-4a3a-93a2-75ee41d8f000","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"tailscaleのブログにあったやつか","ts":"1633661515.250100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hZYLa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7551ff19-f443-4c03-b49c-25f0907f0357","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"bradfitz","ts":"1633661488.249600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RFoSu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec7bb2f6-862a-4950-8b97-f4455d2ae425","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"accept されたらしい","ts":"1633661350.249400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yfxOd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eda1ef99-7b6a-4687-a989-de4da71f157f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/46518\u003e netip","ts":"1633661343.249100","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/46518|#46518 net/netip: add new IP address package, use in net\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/46518|#46518 net/netip: add new IP address package, use in net\u003e","text":"I propose we fix #18804 (net: reconsider representation of IP) by importing the \u003chttps://pkg.go.dev/inet.af/netaddr|`inet.af/netaddr`\u003e into the standard library, probably as `net/netaddr`, so the `IP` type is `netaddr.IP` (the `net` package already has an IP type). We wouldn't need to import all of it, at least not right away, but I think it'd be nice if we did... the package types work together very well.\n\nThis blog post explains the advantages of `netaddr.IP` over `net.IP`:\n\n\u003chttps://tailscale.com/blog/netaddr-new-ip-type-for-go/|https://tailscale.com/blog/netaddr-new-ip-type-for-go/\u003e\n\nNotably, it's small, comparable, and doesn't allocate.\n\nCode is at \u003chttps://github.com/inetaf/netaddr|https://github.com/inetaf/netaddr\u003e. Everybody has a Go CLA filed ( \u003chttps://github.com/inetaf/netaddr/issues/181|inetaf/netaddr#181\u003e) and the license is compatible.\n\nHaving an allocation-free IP address in the standard library means we'd be able to fix #45886 (\"net: add API to receive multiple UDP packets (potentially in one system call)\") which ends with \u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/45886#issuecomment-832885959|golang/go#45886 (comment)\u003e (\"We may want to wait on doing anything here until we figure out what to do with IP addresses, which still allocate.\"). More generally, this would improve Go's UDP performance, which has never gotten much attention. But with things like QUIC and WireGuard (both UDP-based), Go's alloc-heavy UDP handling is starting to get in the way.\n\nYes, we'd then have two IP types in the standard library.\n\nAs part of this, we'd then add:\n\n• conversion funcs in net to go between them (`net` would depend on `netaddr`, not vice-versa)\n• the `net` package internals would switch to `netaddr.IP` for performance/allocs, converting to `net.IP` or `IPAddr` on the edges only.\n• a couple new methods would be added (notably to `UDPConn`) to send/receive UDP packets using `netaddr.IP` alloc-free (we'd then have ~5 ways to send/recv UDP packets instead of ~4)\n\n/cc \u003chttps://github.com/danderson|@danderson\u003e, \u003chttps://github.com/josharian|@josharian\u003e, \u003chttps://github.com/mdlayher|@mdlayher\u003e, \u003chttps://github.com/crawshaw|@crawshaw\u003e, \u003chttps://github.com/tklauser|@tklauser\u003e (co-authors), \u003chttps://github.com/neild|@neild\u003e (co-author for #45886)","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"Proposal, Proposal-Accepted, Proposal-FinalCommentPeriod","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"20","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go|golang/go\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1622647745}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PT5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b01500c-42ab-402c-a7ec-f85ae7d21328","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"気になりすぎたので通知ONにした","ts":"1633660700.248800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cZ+b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fcb0530-24f5-4ddd-a79e-219eb52db25c","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ですね","ts":"1633659390.248500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"02g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a535c31-d089-4e35-8119-5782bdb9f203","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"proposalとかdiscussionじゃないからそんなにすごいのは来ない気がするけど","ts":"1633659371.248300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l4Rp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a666ac5e-feac-4cce-a08b-af8a342a6f4d","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"気になりすぎる","ts":"1633659242.247300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/pBS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ec49b6a-b4ee-4012-a72d-e4745f73956e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"注目の issue です。\n\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/48858\u003e","ts":"1633659156.246900","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/48858|#48858 reserve\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/48858|#48858 reserve\u003e","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go|golang/go\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1633658308}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":7,"users":["U06BRP8VD","UKHUVMBJR","UNJ2DANJC","U8CC7MDCL","U9S4G0LJW","UEACRCY0Z","U011WJ8K6UU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zEiP/"}]}]
